{"id":"e268cabdd8a38c0b","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-cor-marczewski-tree.md","title":"Marczewski Tree","display":"cor-marczewski-tree — Marczewski Tree","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-marczewski-tree","aliases":["58-cor-marczewski-tree"],"display":"cor-marczewski-tree — Marczewski Tree","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-marczewski.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-marczewski-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-marczewski-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-marczewski-tree — Marczewski Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f2a25f6c61231243\" href=\"?note=f2a25f6c61231243\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-marczewski.md\">../batch12/58-df-marczewski.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aba489b7551a80b3\" href=\"?note=aba489b7551a80b3\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s^0_0\\subseteq\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)\">\\(s^0_0\\subseteq\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f2a25f6c61231243\" href=\"?note=f2a25f6c61231243\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-marczewski.md\">../batch12/58-df-marczewski.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"aba489b7551a80b3\" href=\"?note=aba489b7551a80b3\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}marczewski-tree} \\vdash\nA\\notin s^0_0\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(T)\\land\n\\forall S\\subseteq T\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(S)\\to\n\\exists x\\in A\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x\\upharpoonright n\\in S)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}marczewski-tree} \\vdash\nA\\notin s^0_0\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(T)\\land\n\\forall S\\subseteq T\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(S)\\to\n\\exists x\\in A\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x\\upharpoonright n\\in S)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the classical negation-normal-form tree characterization of Marczewski positivity; the body of each perfect subtree is expanded instead of using an undeclared <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[S]\">\\([S]\\)</span> abbreviation.</li>\n<li>It follows directly from the definition of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s^0_0\">\\(s^0_0\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-marczewski.md","status":"resolved","id":"f2a25f6c61231243","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-marczewski.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"aba489b7551a80b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-marczewski.md","status":"resolved","id":"f2a25f6c61231243","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq2^\\omega$ and $s^0_0\\subseteq\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-marczewski.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"aba489b7551a80b3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S\\subseteq V$ (see [[../batch06/58-df-zfc-perfect-tree.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"s^0_0\\subseteq\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}marczewski-tree} \\vdash\nA\\notin s^0_0\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists T\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(T)\\land\n\\forall S\\subseteq T\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{PerfectTree}_S(S)\\to\n\\exists x\\in A\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x\\upharpoonright n\\in S)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"[S]","display":false},{"tex":"s^0_0","display":false}],"bytes":1101,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-76","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-cor-marczewski-tree.md|58-cor-marczewski-tree]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["f2a25f6c61231243","aba489b7551a80b3"]}